<title>FRANCE: DMC 1996 net loss 592 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>DMC 1996 net loss 592 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable	   loss	    592  vs    profit   1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional loss	    338  no comparison</p>
<p>    Turnover				     6,223  vs	   7,120</p>
<p>NOTE - DMC gave its results in a statement. It said the net loss includes exceptional restructuring charges of 282 million francs and 49 million in exceptional gains. Total debt remained at 978 million francs. It said 1996 saw continuing weakness in textile demand in Europe. It will intensify efforts in restructuring European operations, relocating production sites and re-focusing on core activities.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
